, not a separately demonstrated prebiotic synthesis.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\n        \"rxn_002\",\n        \"rxn_004\",\n        \"rxn_005\",\n        \"rxn_008\",\n        \"rxn_009\"\n      ],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\n        \"mol_009\",\n        \"mol_010\",\n        \"mol_013\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P9\",\n      \"name\": \"CO2-sulfite carbon fixation followed by hydroxylamine/iron conversion\",\n      \"description\": \"A coarse-grained photoredox glyoxylate supply feeds the experimentally supported hydroxylamine/iron conversion. The end-to-end environmental coupling, sulfur-product balance, and sufficient hydroxylamine supply remain unresolved.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\n        \"rxn_010\",\n        \"rxn_011\"\n      ],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\n        \"mol_016\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"pathway_id\": \"P10\",\n      \"name\": \"CO2-sulfite carbon fixation followed by candidate ammonia/iron amination\",\n      \"description\": \"Photoredox-supplied glyoxylate enters a proposed ammonia-based reductive amination. This avoids assuming hydroxylamine availability but depends on an unvalidated iron-mediated imine-reduction step.\",\n      \"reaction_sequence\": [\n        \"rxn_010\",\n        \"rxn_012\"\n      ],\n      \"key_intermediates\": [\n        \"mol_016\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"hub_molecules\": [\n    \"mol_001\",\n    \"mol_002\",\n    \"mol_004\",\n    \"mol_008\",\n    \"mol_010\",\n    \"mol_012\",\n    \"mol_016\",\n    \"mol_018\",\n    \"mol_019\",\n    \"mol_020\",\n    \"mol_021\"\n  ],\n  \"convergence_points\": [\n    {\n      \"molecule_id\": \"mol_004\",\n      \"incoming_reactions\": [\n        \"rxn_001\",\n        \"rxn_007\",\n        \"rxn_009\"\n      ],\n      \"outgoing_reactions\": [\n        \"rxn_003\",\n        \"rxn_005\",\n        \"rxn_012\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"molecule_id\": \"mol_008\",\n      \"incoming_reactions\": [\n        \"rxn